abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proofs for the half-erasure instance of Superactivation of private
  classical capacity, using the regularized information formula, together
  with exact mathematical certificates and an explicit coverage map.
  This artifact does not formalize the complete paper or operational coding theorem.
